"""Validate the exact protected OpenTofu 6-to-7 PROD route plan.

The validator consumes only a mode-0600 ``tofu show -json`` artifact.  It never
opens the configured backend, invokes OpenTofu, or contacts Cloudflare.  The
plan must retain the six imported resources, add exactly one DNS record, and
make exactly one narrowly-defined Tunnel configuration update.
"""
