# These are the fields emitted by OpenTofu 1.12.5's jsonplan.Plan.  A few
# compatibility fields are retained because older/newer 1.x encodings can add
# them without changing the meaning of an otherwise safe plan.  Every such
# field has an explicit empty/safe-value check below.
# These are the exact top-level fields emitted by OpenTofu 1.12.5's
# jsonplan.Plan.  Unknown compatibility fields are deliberately rejected: this
# lane is pinned to one CLI/schema and must not silently accept a future surface.
